<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-15 flour exports at 50,374 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-15 flour exports at 50,374 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 50,374 tonnes between January 1 and January 15, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 97,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>First half January exports included 21,254 tonnes for Yemen, 18,620 tonnes for west Africa and 10,500 tonnes for Sudan. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
